OL,3,GNEWSAHospital therapy dog Rolo makes
OL,4,Ahis final rounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA therapy dog that has charmed hospital
OL,7,Fpatients for more than 12 years has
OL,8,Fmade his final rounds for a goodbye pat
OL,9,Fbefore his retirement.
OL,11,FRolo the springer spaniel was close to
OL,12,Fdeath when he was rescued from a puppy
OL,13,Ffarm in South Ockenden in Essex by the
OL,14,FRSPCA, along with dozens of other dogs,
OL,15,Fin 2013.
OL,17,FAfter he was nursed back to health, he
OL,18,Flived with Claire Dean in
OL,19,FSouthend-on-Sea, who decided to train
OL,20,Fhim as a Pets As Therapy (PAT) dog,
OL,21,Fbringing joy to hospital wards, care
OL,22,Fhomes and schools.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
