OL,3,GNEWSAHospital therapy dog Rolo makes
OL,4,Ahis final rounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FRolo had his final day at Ipswich
OL,7,FHospital on Tuesday, which Dean
OL,8,Fdescribed as "emotional".
